. * ============================
. * Analysis
. * ============================
.         xtset pid_couple syear 

Panel variable: pid_couple (unbalanced)
 Time variable: syear, 2001 to 2020, but with gaps
         Delta: 1 unit

.         
. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H3 *
. 
.         * We estimate a linear Fixed Effects model. 
.         * The dependent is constructed as a difference in absolute hours spen
> t on 
.         * housework between male and female respondents sharing a household
.         * The treatment variable is d_daughter, (d_ht) indicator of at least 
> one of 
.         * the partners in the household having a daughter. 
.         * We control for additional individual characteristics of partners an
> d 
.         * year fixed effects. We include potentially constant within individu
> als 
.         * variables for the sake of completeness. However, their estimates wi
> ll be 
.         * omitted in the FE estimation.
.         
.         * We use coule cluster standard errors. 
.         
.         xtreg housework_diff i.d_daughter c.age_male c.age_female i.mig_male 
> i.mig_female i.educ_male i.educ_female i.east  i.syear c.f_weekly_hours_h i.f
> _weekly_hours_h_missing, fe vce(cluster pid_couple)
